{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The chess roguelike. Play game-changing cards, bend the rules, save your Queen, and escape from the dungeon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/8a86051166f620ccf8688b32459792cc.avif?t=1763545765\" width=1532 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat opponents of ever increasing difficulty to escape from the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> your chess army. Start with just a few figures and recruit more as you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong>  cards to turn the tides of the battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat</strong> each enemy Queen on your way to freedom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/185d1bb01c489371f68a642e57fc7f53.webp?t=1763545765\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras_big/185d1bb01c489371f68a642e57fc7f53.webp?t=1763545765 width=800 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/cfc213006da3bde5ab56b11020d1f608.avif?t=1763545765\" width=1532 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards to bend the rules of the game in your favour and win against unbeatable opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/36c41ba989e69d1d4e2bc93d349541b0.poster.avif?t=1763545765\" width=616 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/36c41ba989e69d1d4e2bc93d349541b0.webm?t=1763545765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend mana to play cards such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon a <strong>Shape Shifter</strong> that transforms into a random figure each turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a <strong>zombie outbreak</strong> - zombie figures do not care for the colour and attack white or black equally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch an <strong>ICBM nuke</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>walls</strong> and <strong>traps</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch a <strong>propaganda campaign</strong> to turn enemy figures into your colour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many others!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/185d1bb01c489371f68a642e57fc7f53.webp?t=1763545765\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras_big/185d1bb01c489371f68a642e57fc7f53.webp?t=1763545765 width=800 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/9a535bad9821bff896962e67b0d9599d.avif?t=1763545765\" width=1532 height=468 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win you either need to get smarter or to get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every game you accumulate mana to buy new cards and chess pieces that stay with you in each new run.\u00a0<i>Maybe</i> you would even get a chance at escaping from the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/a6eaf7d072786f06a939f72e02dab8ce.avif?t=1763545765\" width=1600 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of your upgrades will persist between runs, helping you to get closer and closer to the exit. Some will reset with each new run, making each new game unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/f11eb5480e49536f5a3112d916da0040.avif?t=1763545765\" width=1532 height=512 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Humble Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609980/b2b449bc0a0e5e080f892ac53857acda027d8af6.jpg"},{"name":"Cooked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609980/9ddee7bd838c50c78de70a90890b9660779f88d9.jpg"},{"name":"Lady in Red","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609980/034b09274bb5339d3ec6808799b98515d46cf3aa.jpg"},{"name":"Cheer up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609980/06474507c0677b8a6c0abb8de18b9dec81f8ead2.jpg"},{"name":"Doge!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609980/080c81312ac2133e11b0befe409483e33f1c013e.jpg"},{"name":"Grandmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609980/2f99b0ed60199f175ad228b0cf3473f6fff7256a.jpg"},{"name":"Mimic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609980/5bf4d2d7313f592cf3d857c44ec37995687a7c3f.jpg"},{"name":"Drop that beat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3609980/85829b7b4aeac2e93df9c9bc8cfe7408c8d6b965.jpg"}