ong>walls</strong> and <strong>traps</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch a <strong>propaganda campaign</strong> to turn enemy figures into your colour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many others!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/185d1bb01c489371f68a642e57fc7f53.webp?t=1763545765\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras_big/185d1bb01c489371f68a642e57fc7f53.webp?t=1763545765 width=800 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/9a535bad9821bff896962e67b0d9599d.avif?t=1763545765\" width=1532 height=468 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win you either need to get smarter or to get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every game you accumulate mana to buy new cards and chess pieces that stay with you in each new run.\u00a0<i>Maybe</i> you would even get a chance at escaping from the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/a6eaf7d072786f06a939f72e02dab8ce.avif?t=1763545765\" width=1600 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of your upgrades will persist between runs, helping you to get closer and closer to the exit. Some will reset with each new run, making each new game unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609980/extras/f11eb5480e49536f5a3112d916da0040.avif?t=1763545765\" width=1532 height=512 /></span></p>","developers":["Wall Spaghetti"],"genres":[{"descr